Left JOIN  AHRD..MOCTG On MOCTA.TA001=MOCTG.TG014 AND MOCTA.TA002=MOCTG.TG015 
Left JOIN AHRD..MOCTF On MOCTG.TG001=MOCTF.TF001 AND MOCTG.TG002=MOCTF.TF002  
